  <entry>
    <id>aep/rendered-plans-0.43.0</id>
    <title>The plan renders itself, and a conformance report becomes evidence without being retyped</title>
    <updated>2026-09-03T00:00:00Z</updated>
    <link href="https://github.com/beyond10x/aep/releases/tag/0.43.0"/>
    <summary>AEP 0.43.0 lets a documentation site publish plans directly — `artifact board --format markdown` renders the page, `artifact graph --format mermaid` renders the diagram, and each column reads its own ladder `descriptions:`. `artifact evidence --from` converts an `ess-conformance-report/1` into evidence using the report&apos;s recorded run instant.</summary>
  </entry>
